=2 Walkthrough
Retrieve a Key Item dropped from any Goblins in each of the three surrounding Jeuno field areas, used to pop a respective Goblin NM in that zone.
* Any characters currently on (or previously completed) this mission can receive the goblin food key items as long as they are in the same party/alliance.
* These Key Items have a low (5-10%?) obtainment rate, expect to kill dozens of Goblins. If you are in a party/alliance, one character at random will be chosen to receive it (if they don't have it already).
* Party/alliance members do not have to be nearby to receive the key item, they can be anywhere in the zone.
* **NOTE**: You must have the respective Goblin food Key Item when the NM is killed in order to obtain the Seedspall Key Item.

=3 {@k} {k:Seedspall Roseum}
* Kill Goblins in {z:Batallia Downs} to obtain the Key Item {@k} {k:Bowl of bland Goblin salad}.
** They are scattered around the west side of the zone.
* Examine the **???** at (F-5) (middle) to pop {m:Vegnix Greenthumb}, and kill it to receive {@k} {k:Seedspall Roseum}.
** The **???** is on the upper level of the area, which is connected to {z:Beaucedine Glacier}.
*** If you've unlocked the {p:Lycopodium Warps} in the past, trade a flower to the glowing spot at Batallia Downs (F-5) to teleport up.
*** The {p:Survival Guide} will bring you to (H-9) in Beaucedine Glacier. From there, navigate the area to reach the connection at (H-11).
*** You can teleport to Beaucedine Glacier via {p:Voidwatch} NPC (requires level 75 and {@k} {k:Adventurer's Certificate}). Walking there requires going through {z:Ranguemont Pass} (requires {@k} {k:Adventurer's Certificate}).

=3 {@k} {k:Seedspall Caerulum}
* Kill Goblins in {z:Rolanberry Fields} to obtain the Key Item {@k} {k:Jug of greasy Goblin juice}.
* Examine the **???** at (D-11) (NE corner) to pop {m:Chuglix Berrypaws}, and kill it to receive {@k} {k:Seedspall Caerulum}.
** The **???** is on the upper level of the area, which is connected to {z:Crawlers' Nest}.
*** The {p:Unity Warp 125|Category:Unity Concord} to Rolanberry Fields will bring you to (D-11).
*** As it shares the same area as {m:Simurgh}, it can be reached by Voidwatch NPC teleport (Jeuno -> Crawlers' Nest (entrance)).

=3 {@k} {k:Seedspall Viridis}
* Kill Goblins in {z:Sauromugue Champaign} to obtain the Key Item {@k} {k:Chunk of smoked Goblin grub}.
** Some are scattered around the Survival Guide area, which is conveniently close to the **???**.
* Examine the **???** at (J-9) (almost exactly at the I/J-9/10 intersection) to pop {m:Dribblix Greasemaw}, and kill it to receive {@k} {k:Seedspall Viridis}.
** The Survival Guide to Sauromugue Champaign will bring you to (J-10).
** As it shares the same area as {p:Roc}, it can be reached by {p:Voidwatch} NPC teleport (Jeuno > Garlaige Citadel (entrance)).

Finally, examine the **???** at (G-6) in {z:Qufim Island} with the 3 Seedspall Key Items for a cutscene.
=2 "A Crystalline Prophecy" Key
* {c=#FF0000:Note:} Goblin Food Key Items are used to spawn the NMs for the Key Items used on the next mission. Recommend waiting to complete the next steps until you've completed {M:Gatherer of Light (II)|Crystalline Mission 4|Gatherer of Light (II)}
** Goblin Food Key Items are not lost when used to spawn NMs.
* Re-obtain a {@k} {k:Bowl of bland Goblin salad}, {@k} {k:Jug of greasy Goblin juice}, and {@k} {k:Chunk of smoked Goblin grub}, if needed.
* Head to {z:Port Jeuno} and speak to {n:Squintrox Dryeyes} (G-8) to receive {@k} {k:Viridian Key}.
** You will lose your {@k} {k:Bowl of bland Goblin salad}, {@k} {k:Jug of greasy Goblin juice}, and {@k} {k:Chunk of smoked Goblin grub}.
** The key can be received once per day.
** Accepting the {@k} {k:Viridian Key} triggers a time limit (one real day __(verification needed)__) for the quest {M:Gatherer of Light (II)|Crystalline Mission 4|Gatherer of Light (II)}.
** {n:Squintrox Dryeyes} will refuse to give you a {@k} {k:Viridian Key} if you already did ( Gatherer of Light (I) __(verification needed)__ or {M:Gatherer of Light (II)|Crystalline Mission 4|Gatherer of Light (II)} __(verification needed)__ ) on the same day.
*** Refusal message is ""Woah, woah! Slow down there, bud. Gimme some time to sort out the stuff you just sold me, why don't ya?"
* Use the {@k} {k:Viridian Key} (Level 40) to open the red treasure coffer at {z:Lower Jeuno} (J-8).
** Rewards are listed on the {p:Add-on Scenario Rewards} page.

